WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:01.652
Oh no!

2
00:00:01.598 --> 00:00:04.502
Building a street by hand takes all day!

3
00:00:04.502 --> 00:00:06.620
And nothing matches!

4
00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:10.132
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

5
00:00:10.132 --> 00:00:12.846
This is Episode 64.

6
00:00:12.846 --> 00:00:14.888
Meet the town stamp.

7
00:00:14.888 --> 00:00:16.714
Look underneath.

8
00:00:16.714 --> 00:00:19.035
A picture of the whole street.

9
00:00:19.035 --> 00:00:20.468
Stamp!

10
00:00:20.468 --> 00:00:24.044
The street pops up, exactly like the picture.

11
00:00:24.044 --> 00:00:25.806
Stamp again!

12
00:00:25.806 --> 00:00:28.558
Another street, just the same.

13
00:00:28.558 --> 00:00:30.346
Want flowers?

14
00:00:30.346 --> 00:00:32.451
Add them to the picture.

15
00:00:32.451 --> 00:00:33.884
Stamp!

16
00:00:33.884 --> 00:00:36.548
Now every stand has flowers.

17
00:00:36.548 --> 00:00:38.412
Done with a street?

18
00:00:38.412 --> 00:00:40.377
Lift and twist.

19
00:00:40.377 --> 00:00:42.533
Everything folds away.

20
00:00:42.533 --> 00:00:44.689
Nothing left behind.

21
00:00:44.689 --> 00:00:46.515
Draw it once.

22
00:00:46.515 --> 00:00:48.481
Stamp it anywhere.

23
00:00:48.481 --> 00:00:50.649
That is the town stamp.

24
00:00:50.649 --> 00:00:53.845
Now you know AWS CloudFormation!

25
00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:57.700
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

